Subject: [PATCH] H2: Crypto review phase closed (50 vectors, 6 mutation
 controls)

50 golden crypto vectors from an independent oracle (pure-Python RFC 8032 +
python blake3 + from-spec domain_message): byte-for-byte sign/verify, keygen,
digest layout, edge payloads; negatives: wrong domain, cross chain, tampered
payload, wrong key, high-S malleation. verify_raw now rejects S >= L with
CryptoError::NonCanonicalSignature (the (R, S+L) twin; dalek's
legacy_compatibility feature would reopen the window). Side-channel
checklist: 10 machine-readable items with source-claim checks
(tools/check_h2_review.py); PQ plan (ML-DSA FIPS 204 primary, SLH-DSA
FIPS 205 backup). Named control shared_domain; mutation controls 6/6.
